<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Spanish first division soccer matches on Saturday.</p>
<p>Compostela 3 (Nacho Fernandez 28th minute, Christopher Ohen 64th, Juan Viedma 90th) Atletico Madrid 1 (Juan Eduardo Esnaider 45th). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 10,000.</p>
<p>Barcelona 2 (Giovanni 83rd, Juan Pizzi 90th) Espanyol 1 (Jordi</p>
<p>Lardin 70th). Halftime 0-0. Attendance 107,000.</p>
<p>Logrones 0 Tenerife 1 (Felipe Minambres 12th). 0-1. 17,000.</p>
<p>Valencia 0 Real Sociedad 1 (Darko Kovacevic, 18th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 40,000.</p>
